# Blix's own project: the engine, its tools, and the suites that judge it.
blix

# What `blix test` runs here. The step run most often in a session — five
# invocations and a person reading five outputs, until this line existed.
test: Blix.Test.Graphics, Blix.Test.Diagnostics, Blix.Test.Physics2D, Blix.Test.Physics3D, Blix.Test.Apps, Blix.Test.Studio
